|desc=
Consume a soul to empower one of your skeleton, making it into a Lord of Skulls.

The Lord of Skulls gains {{cts|30|80}} more life and is instantly healed to full.

There can be only one active Lord of Skulls, casting this spell on another skeleton removes the effect from the current one.

It also gains a new talent if high enough:

* At level 2 Warriors learn {{t|Giant Leap}}, a powerful jump attack that deals damage and dazes on impact and frees the skeleton from any stun, daze and pin effects they may have
* At level 3 Archers learn {{t|Vital Shot}}, a devastating attack that can stun and cripple their foes
* At level 5 Mages learn {{t|Meteoric Crash}}, a destructive spell that crushes and burns foes in a big radius for multiple turns and stuns them
* At level 6 Bone Giants learn {{t|You Shall Be My Weapon}}, a massive attack that deals high damage, knockbacks foes and stuns them
